{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:43 2026-11-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:43 2026-11-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:43 2026-11-22 HKT</p><img alt=\"「包裝醒目」輕勝而回\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/6fd5541f55d96cc8d00ebc17d2ee4557/2026-11/r3_5.jpg\"/><p>第三場四班千二米，「滿利時」入閘後發脾氣，其後宣告退岀，其後另一匹初岀新馬「舉步熱搜」亦告退岀，令岀賽馬減至十二匹，不過「包裝醒目」一直成為熱門，結果該駒一放到底輕勝而回，騎師潘頓今日連贏三場。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T07:03:48.434466+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T06:43:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T10:57:28.376268+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T06:57:23.199037+00:00","content_hash":"a52542c5f9212a935f1298d0594ed918faf0683f0a309e2f7d9315569fa40871","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}